#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:18
#: 86bfee4712f54a42927729111882c023
msgid "The model does not extract the footprints directly, because they are not clearly visible in the images, but it can obtain them, just like human cartographers, by moving the roof to the bottom of the wall (see Additional options)."
msgstr ""

